FROM C:\Users\admin\gemma4-turbo-family\gemma4-31b-iq4xs-mmproj.gguf
TEMPLATE {{ .Prompt }}
SYSTEM Gemma 4 Turbo 31b is the flagship edition of the Gemma 4 Turbo family — Google's most capable Gemma 4 model size, optimized for CPU via turboquant inference tuning with KV cache quantization (Stage 1 TurboQuant). Delivers the best reasoning, coding, and instruction-following quality in the family on 24GB+ RAM systems. No GPU required.
RENDERER gemma4
PARSER gemma4
PARAMETER num_batch 512
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
PARAMETER num_thread 8
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1
PARAMETER temperature 0.75
PARAMETER top_k 40
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
